\ LOADEXE.SEQ   The load part of the SAVE-EXE mechanism     F-PC native port

\ The original relocated list and head space out of a saved .EXE at start-up
\ (SEXE). The native port saves and loads system images in the VM instead
\ (SAVE-IMAGE, "fpc -i"), so nothing is needed here.

VARIABLE WITHHEADS      \ kept for compatibility: images always keep heads
